DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45348::$$$message_0416_0000_0000$$$::"A Holy Grail bath? That sounds absurd. As if such a ridiculous wish-granter exists."::
45349::$$$message_0416_0000_0001$$$::"...Hey, Kiritsugu? I think that kind of pessimism is too much, even for you."::
45350::$$$message_0416_0000_0002$$$::"I'm sure it's just disinformation meant to distract us."::
45351::$$$message_0416_0000_0003$$$::"They're expecting Masters to be lured out by a substitute Grail. It's advanced information warfare."::
45352::$$$message_0416_0000_0004$$$::"Am I right to conclude that we can disregard this ploy, Master?"::
45353::$$$message_0416_0000_0005$$$::"..."::
45354::$$$message_0416_0000_0006$$$::"Iri, one option would be to pretend to fall for the trap."::
45355::$$$message_0416_0000_0007$$$::"We have a Servant and a fake Master to use as a decoy."::
45356::$$$message_0416_0000_0008$$$::"I feel like you just said something that I can't ignore..."::
45357::$$$message_0416_0000_0009$$$::"This onsen event might not fit the tone of a Holy Grail War, but if we can have you and Saber participate..."::
45358::$$$message_0416_0000_0010$$$::"It might make other Masters think that this is the true objective."::
45359::$$$message_0416_0000_0011$$$::"And if it's interpreted as a bit of sexy fanservice to appease the sponsors, that will make it seem even more credible."::
45360::$$$message_0416_0000_0012$$$::"Kiritsugu... I feel like someone's been transmitting bizarre signals into your brain ever since you arrived in Fuyuki."::
45361::$$$message_0416_0000_0013$$$::"You and Saber will pretend to go on a hot springs trip. [wvl][hfwww layer=2]Once the other Masters begin to vie with each other, I'll strike them down from behind."::
45362::$$$message_0416_0000_0014$$$::"We'll call this Operation Steam Sniper... This could work."::
45363::$$$message_0416_0000_0015$$$::"Hehehe. You're so excited, Kiritsugu. I love it when you show your adorable side every once in a while."::
45364::$$$message_0416_0000_0016$$$::"Not only am I completely failing to follow this conversation, my A-rank Intuition skill is detecting an incredibly ominous aura..."::
45365::$$$message_0416_0000_0017$$$::"It's okay, Saber! Just think of it as a vacation and try to relax!"::
45366::$$$message_0416_0000_0018$$$::"I've always been curious about Japan's open-air baths. I wonder what it'll be like..."::
45367::$$$message_0416_0000_0019$$$::(...Am I really going to be able to save Britain here?)::

